{
    "Description": "<pre class=\"ql-syntax\" spellcheck=\"false\">DEVactive()\n</pre><p><br></p><p>Very easy to use.</p><p><br></p><p>This is helpful in the mini web application framework.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>RETURNS</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Returns true if component is in Development mode. <em><u>boolean</u></em></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>EXAMPLE</strong></p><p><br></p><pre class=\"ql-syntax\" spellcheck=\"false\">local IsDev = DEVactive();\n</pre><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
    "Name": "DEVactive",
    "Parameters": null,
    "ParameterTable": false,
    "SummaryLine": "Returns true if component is in Development mode"
}